constitutive rule art 3 par 1 is established in "https://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2019/881/oj/eng/art_3/par_1".

constitutive rule art 3 par 1 has the legal text "The mission of ENISA is to support Member States and Union entities in achieving a high level of cybersecurity, cyber resilience and trust within the Union.".

constitutive rule art 3 par 1 has the comment "Constitutes ENISA's primary institutional mission.".


constitutive rule art 3 par 2 is identified by "http://data.europa.eu/leg/lomo/lfds-CSA2#ConstitutiveRule_Art3_Par2".

