constitutive rule art 3 par 2 has the legal text "ENISA shall act as a reference point for advice and expertise on cybersecurity for Member States, as well as for other stakeholders in the Union.".

constitutive rule art 3 par 2 has the comment "Constitutes ENISA's institutional role as reference point for cybersecurity expertise.".


constitutive rule art 3 par 3 is identified by "http://data.europa.eu/leg/lomo/lfds-CSA2#ConstitutiveRule_Art3_Par3".

