constitutive rule art 3 par 3 has the legal text "ENISA shall contribute to reducing the fragmentation of the internal market by carrying out the tasks assigned to it under this Regulation.".

constitutive rule art 3 par 3 has the comment "Constitutes ENISA's role in internal market integration.".


constitutive rule art 3 par 4 is identified by "http://data.europa.eu/leg/lomo/lfds-CSA2#ConstitutiveRule_Art3_Par4".

