% The questions of LOMO's requirements document (its competency questions),
% as far as a description can answer them.
scenario description is, as stated in the source description:
    modalities expects answers ["requirement art 15 par 1 has the modality obligation", "requirement art 15 par 2 has the modality obligation"].
    actions_of_rules expects answers ["requirement art 15 par 1 produces action art 15 par 1 provide tools platforms", "requirement art 15 par 2 produces action art 15 par 2 cooperate exchange"].
    actions_of_agents expects answers ["agent csir ts network acts as addressee in action art 15 par 2 cooperate exchange", "agent enisa acts as addresser in action art 15 par 1 provide tools platforms", "agent enisa acts as addresser in action art 15 par 2 cooperate exchange", "agent market surveillance authorities acts as addressee in action art 15 par 2 cooperate exchange"].

